［``Nami Urarakani, Meoto Biyori'' is...]

533
00:45:04,744 --> 00:45:08,744
Is this… a hospital?

534
00:45:08,744 --> 00:45:11,744
You woke up.

535
00:45:11,744 --> 00:45:13,744
Why am I here?

536
00:45:13,744 --> 00:45:16,744
(Nurse) Don't you remember? A place where I fell down in the city ➡

537
00:45:16,744 --> 00:45:19,744
Someone passing by brought it to me.

538
00:45:28,271 --> 00:45:34,271
(Natsu) Haa... haa... haa...

539
00:45:34,271 --> 00:45:36,271
OK?

540
00:45:41,271 --> 00:45:43,271
(Taki) Let's go to the hospital.

541
00:45:58,923 --> 00:46:01,923
Oh, what about that person?

542
00:46:01,923 --> 00:46:05,923
Come to think of it, he disappeared before I knew it.

543
00:46:05,923 --> 00:46:07,923
Huh? (Nurse) Doctor, I'll call you➡

544
00:46:07,923 --> 00:46:09,923
Wait for me.

545
00:46:18,921 --> 00:46:21,921
Who… I wonder what it is.
